Use resilient font fallbacks. Keep dense data, tables, forms, and finance views legible.

### Graphic system

Create reusable SVG/CSS components for halftone, ink marks, technical labels, offset shadows, comic panels, stamps, divider motifs, and character containers. Do not depend on random hotlinked images for core brand art.

