## 10. Technical scope

Frontend only:
- Next.js App Router.
- React + TypeScript.
- Tailwind CSS.
- Reusable typed components.
- Local mock data.
- Lightweight charts.
- Lucide icons plus original SVG brand artwork.

Do not build a backend, database, payment system, OAuth connection, credential storage, real agent runtime, or external marketplace integration in this phase. Keep components modular and ready for later API contracts without over-engineering.

If a repository already exists, inspect it before changing conventions. Avoid unnecessary dependencies. Ensure no broken routes, TypeScript errors, console errors, overflow, inaccessible dialogs, or nonfunctional controls.

